{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:0.1"], "en": "Theragāthā 2.46 Dukanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:0.2", "PA_thag_2.46:0.3"], "en": "Pañcamavagga (The Fifth Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:0.4"], "en": "Cūḷaka Thera’s Verses:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:1.1"], "en": "“Peacocks cry out— those with beautiful crests and fine plumage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:1.2"], "en": "with necks as dark blue as sapphire, with lovely faces, and with beautiful calls.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:1.3"], "en": "This great earth is well-provided with moisture,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:1.4"], "en": "the sky is filled with beautiful clouds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:2.1"], "en": "and for one who meditates with a happy mind, the form of the lotus is lovely.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:2.2"], "en": "Exert yourself well in the teaching of the Well-Awakened One;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:2.3", "PA_thag_2.46:2.4"], "en": "touch that supreme, deathless state which is exceedingly bright, pure, subtle, and very difficult to see.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.46:2.5"], "en": "… the Elder Cūḷaka …", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
]
